 the community bestiary's cell colors (red: day, blue: night, yellow: under that weather), places off the community maps. 'mutated'/'adapted' on a lockbox farm: the kind of change; the condition is when it happens. Left out: the two night mobs that mutate only under Thunder (both conditions).",
